    "Attack Attribute": "None",
    "Defense Attributes": "Fire 20, Water 20, Wind 53, Earth 20, Holy 20, Unholy 20",
    "Skills": "Raid Boss Lv. 1 Raid Boss reward chance is reduced based on the level difference. Boss is higher: +5 - 85%, +6 - 70%, +7 - 50%, +8 - 35%. Player is higher: +6 - 85%, +7 - 70%, +8 - 50%. If player is 9 or more levels higher, Raid Curse is applied. Raid Boss Lv. 1 A shaman of the village, she witnessed Elmore invaders poisoning the well and looked the other way in fear of her life. But when she saw the villagers die one by one, she realized what she had done and lost her mind. She still wanders near the cursed well, and recklessly attacks anyone who comes close, thinking that they are Elmore soldiers. Demons Lv. 9 Takes 15% increased damage from attacks that are effective against Demons. M. Atk. +10 Atk. Spd. +5% Vampiric Rage effect +1% Bow Skill Vampiric Rage effect +2% Resistance to Dark +10% P. Def. -5% Resistance to Holy -10% Resistance to Blunt -10% Resistance to Dual Blunt -10% Dark Attack Lv. 1 Unleashes a dark attack. Dark Attack Resistance Lv. 5 Resistant to Dark attacks. Resist Full Magic Attack Lv. 1",
